{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "hl-observability-prometheus-operator",
  "title": "Prometheus Operator",
  "description": "Prometheus Operator (deployment prometheus-operator): turns ServiceMonitors, PodMonitors, PrometheusRules and the Prometheus/Alertmanager CRs into running config. Panels follow the alert rules of the official prometheus-operator mixin (https://github.com/prometheus-operator/prometheus-operator/tree/main/jsonnet/mixin). No upstream dashboard exists for the operator.",
  "tags": [
    "observability",
    "prometheus-operator"
  ],
  "timezone": "",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": false,
        "iconColor": "red",
        "name": "Firing alerts",
        "expr": "ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\", alertname=~\"PrometheusOperator.*|ConfigReloaderSidecarErrors\"}",
        "step": "60s",
        "titleFormat": "{{alertname}} ({{severity}})",
        "textFormat": "Prometheus ALERTS series in state firing. See Alertmanager / alert rules for details.",
        "tagKeys": "severity",
        "useValueForTime": false
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": false,
        "iconColor": "orange",
        "name": "Container restarts",
        "expr": "changes(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{namespace=\"monitoring\", pod=~\"prometheus-operator-.*\"}[2m]) > 0",
        "step": "60s",
        "titleFormat": "Restart: {{pod}} / {{container}}",
        "textFormat": "kube-state-metrics saw the restart counter change (crash, OOMKill or liveness failure).",
        "tagKeys": "container",
        "useValueForTime": false
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": false,
        "iconColor": "orange",
        "name": "Operator reconciles with errors",
        "expr": "sum by (controller) (increase(prometheus_operator_reconcile_errors_total{job=\"prometheus-operator\", namespace=\"monitoring\"}[2m])) > 0",
        "step": "60s",
        "titleFormat": "Reconcile error: {{controller}}",
        "textFormat": "The operator failed to reconcile a Prometheus/Alertmanager object.",
        "tagKeys": "controller",
        "useValueForTime": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Observability",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "observability"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true,
      "targetBlank": false
    },
    {
      "title": "prometheus-operator mixin",
      "url": "https://github.com/prometheus-operator/prometheus-operator/tree/main/jsonnet/mixin",
      "type": "link",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "icon": "doc"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "The **Prometheus Operator** watches CRDs in every namespace and renders them into the Prometheus and\nAlertmanager configuration (secrets mounted in `prometheus-kps-0` / `alertmanager-kps-0`, applied by the\nconfig-reloader sidecars). If it breaks, Prometheus keeps running the **last good config**: new ServiceMonitors and\nPrometheusRules are silently ignored.\n\n**Healthy**: Ready = 1, *Rejected resources* = 0, *Syncs failed* = 0, reconcile/list/watch error ratios at 0.\n\n**When red**\n- *Rejected resources > 0* → a ServiceMonitor/PodMonitor/PrometheusRule is invalid and was skipped:\n  `kubectl --context k8s01 -n monitoring logs deploy/prometheus-operator | grep -i -E \"rejected|invalid\"`.\n- *Sync failed* → the operator could not generate the StatefulSet/config for Prometheus or Alertmanager.\n- *List/watch errors* → RBAC or API-server problems.\n\nFormulas mirror the [prometheus-operator mixin](https://github.com/prometheus-operator/prometheus-operator/tree/main/jsonnet/mixin) alerts. Note: the kube-prometheus-stack copy of those\nalerts selects `job=\"kps-operator\"`, but the scrape job here is `prometheus-operator`, so they never fire (see\ndocs/dashboards/observability.md).",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext"
        }
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Active alerts for this service",
      "id": 21,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Prometheus alerts of this service that are FIRING (condition true for longer than the rule's `for`) or PENDING (condition true, waiting for `for`). Same filter as the red alert annotations of this dashboard; Watchdog/InfoInhibitor are excluded. Empty = healthy. Alertmanager has no receiver in this lab, so dashboards are where alerts are seen: the rule, its threshold and source are in the rule files (helm-charts/<app>/**/prometheus.rules.yaml or the -raw release) and in docs/dashboards/. All alerts of the lab: dashboard \"Alerts overview\" (Observability folder).",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "ALERTS{alertname!~\"Watchdog|InfoInhibitor\", alertstate=~\"firing|pending\", alertname=~\"PrometheusOperator.*|ConfigReloaderSidecarErrors\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          },
          "noValue": "No active alerts"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "alertstate"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "state"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background",
                  "mode": "basic"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "firing": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "pending": {
                        "color": "orange",
                        "index": 1
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "severity"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "critical": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "warning": {
                        "color": "orange",
                        "index": 1
                      },
                      "info": {
                        "color": "blue",
                        "index": 2
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "prometheus": true,
              "endpoint": true,
              "service": true,
              "instance": true,
              "uid": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "alertname": 0,
              "alertstate": 1,
              "severity": 2,
              "namespace": 3
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
