      "description": "Reconcile errors / reconcile operations per controller (mixin alert PrometheusOperatorReconcileErrors fires above 10% for 10m: `rate(prometheus_operator_reconcile_errors_total[5m]) / rate(prometheus_operator_reconcile_operations_total[5m])`).",
